      "instance_name": "woman",
      "label": "person",
      "description": "A woman with blonde hair, wearing a white shirt and black blazer, with duct tape over her mouth. She is posing with one hand on her head and the other on her hip, conveying a sense of being silenced or gagged. This is the central visual element and the subject of the meme's metaphor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
